cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or study CGMP, please cite CGMP Project and the relevant release."
title: "Cost-Grounded Mobility Pricing (CGMP)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CGMP Project"
version: "1.1-preprint"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gihan-kanishka/cgmp"
url: "https://github.com/gihan-kanishka/cgmp"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  An open ride-hailing fare and dispatch framework with representative
  ICE-based fare calibration, explicit driver-time compensation,
  passenger-controlled progressive pickup search, and exceptional
  first-qualifying sealed dispatch after deterministic expanded search fails.
keywords:
  - ride-hailing
  - mobility pricing
  - transport economics
  - progressive search
  - sealed bidding
  - driver compensation
  - market design
